sequenceDiagram
    actor PM as Project Manager
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Atlas
    participant RAG as Azure AI Search (RAG)
    participant LLM as Azure AI Foundry Agent
    participant Plan as Planning Tools
    participant Planner as Microsoft Planner
    participant Teams as Microsoft Teams
    participant SPO as SharePoint
    participant Bus as Event Bus
    participant Orchestrator
    participant Sentinel

    PM->>API: POST /projects/ingest (brief text)
    API->>Atlas: run_full_pipeline(brief)
    activate Atlas
    Atlas->>RAG: retrieve_rag_documents(brief)
    RAG-->>Atlas: methodology guides, templates, historical lessons
    Atlas->>LLM: chat(TASK=methodology_selection)
    LLM-->>Atlas: methodology + rationale + confidence
    Atlas->>LLM: chat(TASK=complexity_scoring)
    LLM-->>Atlas: complexity_score
    Atlas->>Plan: generate_wbs(), detect_dependencies(),\ncalculate_critical_path(), generate_sprint_plan()
    Plan-->>Atlas: phases, epics, tasks, milestones, dependencies, sprints
    Atlas->>SPO: create_project_folder()
    Atlas->>Teams: create_channel() + send_teams_message()
    Atlas->>Planner: create_plan() + create_bucket() x N + create_task() x N
    Planner-->>Atlas: planner task IDs
    Atlas->>Bus: emit(atlas.plan.created)
    deactivate Atlas
    Bus->>Orchestrator: atlas.plan.created
    Orchestrator->>Sentinel: monitor_project(project_id)
    Sentinel-->>Orchestrator: initial health snapshot
    API-->>PM: 200 OK (Project with methodology, phases, tasks)
